## Architecture

Clean Architecture (Domain → Use Cases → Adapters) on top of Rails.

```
app/
  domain/                        # inner layer: entities + repository interfaces
    {{#each modules}}
    {{snakeCase this}}/
      entities/
        {{snakeCase this}}.rb    # domain entity (pure Ruby, no AR dependency)
      repositories/
        {{snakeCase this}}_repository_interface.rb
    {{/each}}
  use_cases/                     # application layer: use cases / interactors
    {{#each modules}}
    {{snakeCase this}}/
      list_{{snakeCase this}}s.rb
      get_{{snakeCase this}}.rb
      create_{{snakeCase this}}.rb
      update_{{snakeCase this}}.rb
      delete_{{snakeCase this}}.rb
    {{/each}}
  adapters/                      # outer layer: controllers, AR repos, serializers
    controllers/
      api/
        {{#each modules}}
        {{snakeCase this}}s_controller.rb
        {{/each}}
    repositories/
      active_record/
        {{#each modules}}
        {{snakeCase this}}_repository.rb
        {{/each}}
    serializers/
      {{#each modules}}
      {{snakeCase this}}_serializer.rb
      {{/each}}
```
